<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech unit Elin sells Spanish subsidiary.</title>
<headline>VA Tech unit Elin sells Spanish subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elin Energieanwendung, a unit of blue-chip engineering group VA Technologie AG, said on Thursday it had sold its Spanish subsidiary G.H. Elin International to Aplicaciones Electrotermicas of Valencia.</p>
<p>In a statement Elin said the sales fitted with its strategy of focusing on its core business.</p>
<p>It gave no price details. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
